window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>I’ve been content with it just being us for a while, but it's my last year of high school, and I’ve missed out on so much. Parties, girlfriends, and dating. If I can’t have them in the way my heart wants, I may as well start having fun, right?</p> <p>Wrong, because they don’t seem to like my new life choices. But they’re not the same boys I grew up with. Sneaking out at night, disappearing for hours, keeping secrets. The closer I look, the more I’m starting to realize that the boys I thought I knew better than anyone else are hiding something from me. Something dark and sinister.</p> <p>Someone runs our little town of Black Ridge, and I think I just might know who they are....</p>"; 
